# ForgePanel environment overrides — sourced by the systemd unit.
#
# This file only selects a non-default data directory. Panel port, domain,
# HTTPS, ACME and other operator settings are persisted in panel.json and must
# be changed through the authenticated web UI or `sudo forgectl settings set`.
#
# Data directory (SQLite database, secrets, certificates). Must be writable and
# is created 0700 by the package.
#FORGEPANEL_DATA=/var/lib/forgepanel
